# Drop real samples here to override the procedural sound synthesis.
#
# Recognised names (any of .wav .mp3 .ogg .flac .m4a):
#   whoosh  impact  impact_heavy  block  super  ko  land  step
#
# Anything missing is synthesised in src/audio.py, so this folder can stay
# empty and the render still has full sound.
#
# Audio files in this folder are gitignored — don't commit samples you don't
# have the rights to.
